flowchart TD
    A([Start]) --> B[Register Account]
    B --> C[Send OTP]
    C --> D[Verify OTP and Log In]
    D --> E[Submit Application and Requirements]
    E --> F[Record as Submitted / Initial Review]
    F --> G[Review Documents]
    G --> H{Documents Complete?}
    H -- No --> I[Set Pending Resubmission]
    I --> J[Resubmit Documents]
    J --> G
    H -- Yes --> K[Set For Interview]
    K --> L[Schedule Interview]
    L --> M[Attend Interview]
    M --> N{Interview Passed?}
    N -- No --> O[Close as Not Eligible]
    N -- Yes --> P[Set Eligible Awaiting SOA]
    P --> Q[Upload SOA]
    Q --> R[Review SOA]
    R --> S{SOA Approved?}
    S -- No --> T[Set SOA Resubmission Required]
    T --> U[Resubmit SOA]
    U --> R
    S -- Yes --> V[Set Approved Pending Payroll]
    V --> W[Create Payout Schedule]
    W --> X[Receive Payout Schedule]
    X --> Y[Release Scholarship Payout]
    Y --> Z([Approved Finished])
